WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.249
RUFUS: Unless the internal
audience already knows more than

00:00:02.249 --> 00:00:04.498
RUFUS: the press release says,
which is entirely possible.

00:00:04.498 --> 00:00:06.747
RUFUS: These things rarely stay
completely contained inside a

00:00:06.747 --> 00:00:08.996
RUFUS: company.

00:00:09.061 --> 00:00:11.626
ALEX: So what changed today,
concretely?

00:00:11.711 --> 00:00:14.619
RUFUS: The executive vacuum is
closed. The market had

00:00:14.619 --> 00:00:17.526
RUFUS: a week of pricing in
various worst cases.

00:00:17.526 --> 00:00:20.434
RUFUS: The reinstatement resets
the baseline.

00:00:20.544 --> 00:00:23.147
JAMIE: And the investigation
becomes the thing to watch.

00:00:23.147 --> 00:00:25.750
JAMIE: Not because we know it'll
produce a damaging

00:00:25.750 --> 00:00:28.353
JAMIE: finding, but because it's
unresolved and it involves

00:00:28.353 --> 00:00:30.956
JAMIE: the same circumstances that
caused a brief but

00:00:30.956 --> 00:00:33.559
JAMIE: real leadership crisis at
the most important company

00:00:33.559 --> 00:00:36.162
JAMIE: in AI hardware.
